{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-43608","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49835","text":"--- name: review description: Use before high-stakes actions, after learning phases, after outcome failures, or when the user asks \"do we know enough?\", \"should we proceed?\", \"review coverage\", \"check readiness\", \"coverage check\". Epistemic self-modeling — decides act/learn/escalate. Routes through "},{"id":"spn-49836","marks":["code"],"text":"route"},{"id":"spn-49837","text":" and "},{"id":"spn-49838","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-49839","text":" machines. argument-hint: <goal_id> ---"}]},{"id":"blk-43609","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49840","text":"Coverage and Review"}]},{"id":"blk-43610","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49841","text":"Evaluate whether you know enough to act on a goal, or need to learn more."}]},{"id":"blk-43611","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49842","text":"Arguments"}]},{"id":"blk-43612","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49843","text":"Goal to review: $ARGUMENTS"}]},{"id":"blk-43613","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49844","text":"Review Coverage"}]},{"id":"blk-43614","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"route(action: \"review_goal\",\n  goal_id: \"<id>\",\n  signal: {\n    \"retrieved_nodes\": [{\"node_id\": \"abc\", \"confidence\": 0.8, \"similarity\": 0.85}],\n    \"outcomes\": [{\"action_id\": \"fix-auth\", \"status\": \"success\", \"confidence\": 0.9}],\n    \"contradictions\": 0,\n    \"knowledge_gaps\": [\"How does the rate limiter interact with auth?\"],\n    \"supporting_evidence_count\": 5,\n    \"coverage_estimate\": 0.7\n  },\n  apply_decision: true\n)"},{"id":"blk-43615","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49845","marks":["bold"],"text":"Returns:"},{"id":"spn-49846","text":" "},{"id":"spn-49847","marks":["code"],"text":"decision"},{"id":"spn-49848","text":" (act/learn/escalate), "},{"id":"spn-49849","marks":["code"],"text":"coverage_score"},{"id":"spn-49850","text":", "},{"id":"spn-49851","marks":["code"],"text":"uncertainty_score"},{"id":"spn-49852","text":", "},{"id":"spn-49853","marks":["code"],"text":"risk_score"},{"id":"spn-49854","text":", "},{"id":"spn-49855","marks":["code"],"text":"rationale"},{"id":"spn-49856","text":", "},{"id":"spn-49857","marks":["code"],"text":"applied_review"},{"id":"spn-49858","text":", "},{"id":"spn-49859","marks":["code"],"text":"transition"},{"id":"spn-49860","text":" (if apply_decision was true), "},{"id":"spn-49861","marks":["code"],"text":"evaluation"},{"id":"spn-49862","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-43616","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49863","text":"Decision Policy"}]},{"id":"blk-43617","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43619","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49864","marks":["bold"],"text":"act"},{"id":"spn-49865","text":" — coverage adequate, proceed with execution"}]}],"id":"blk-43618","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43621","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49866","marks":["bold"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-49867","text":" — gaps exist, gather more info, then re-review"}]}],"id":"blk-43620","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43623","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49868","marks":["bold"],"text":"escalate"},{"id":"spn-49869","text":" — critically low coverage or high risk, mark blocked, get external help"}]}],"id":"blk-43622","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-43624","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49870","text":"If "},{"id":"spn-49871","marks":["code"],"text":"apply_decision: true"},{"id":"spn-49872","text":", the goal auto-transitions: act -> active, learn -> proposed, escalate -> blocked."}]},{"id":"blk-43625","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49873","text":"Tuning Options"}]},{"id":"blk-43626","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49874","text":"Pass "},{"id":"spn-49875","marks":["code"],"text":"options"},{"id":"spn-49876","text":" to customize evaluation thresholds:"}]},{"id":"blk-43627","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"route(action: \"review_goal\",\n  goal_id: \"<id>\",\n  signal: { ... },\n  options: {\n    \"top_k\": 10,\n    \"min_context_nodes\": 3,\n    \"freshness_half_life_hours\": 48,\n    \"graph_support_target\": 0.6,\n    \"weights\": {\"coverage\": 0.4, \"confidence\": 0.3, \"freshness\": 0.2, \"support\": 0.1},\n    \"thresholds\": {\"act\": 0.7, \"learn\": 0.4}\n  }\n)"},{"id":"blk-43628","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43630","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49877","marks":["code"],"text":"top_k"},{"id":"spn-49878","text":" — how many top nodes to consider for scoring"}]}],"id":"blk-43629","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43632","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49879","marks":["code"],"text":"min_context_nodes"},{"id":"spn-49880","text":" — minimum linked nodes needed for adequate coverage"}]}],"id":"blk-43631","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43634","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49881","marks":["code"],"text":"freshness_half_life_hours"},{"id":"spn-49882","text":" — decay rate for old evidence"}]}],"id":"blk-43633","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43636","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49883","marks":["code"],"text":"graph_support_target"},{"id":"spn-49884","text":" — target ratio of supporting edges"}]}],"id":"blk-43635","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43638","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49885","marks":["code"],"text":"weights"},{"id":"spn-49886","text":" — custom scoring dimension weights"}]}],"id":"blk-43637","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43640","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49887","marks":["code"],"text":"thresholds"},{"id":"spn-49888","text":" — custom decision boundaries (above act threshold = act, below learn threshold = escalate)"}]}],"id":"blk-43639","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-43641","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49889","text":"Building Honest Signals"}]},{"id":"blk-43642","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49890","text":"Build the "},{"id":"spn-49891","marks":["code"],"text":"signal"},{"id":"spn-49892","text":" from REAL retrieval data — never fabricate:"}]},{"id":"blk-43643","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49893","text":"1. "},{"id":"spn-49894","marks":["bold"],"text":"Always retrieve first"},{"id":"spn-49895","text":" — run "},{"id":"spn-49896","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"context\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49897","text":" before building the signal 2. "},{"id":"spn-49898","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieved_nodes"},{"id":"spn-49899","text":" — from actual results (include node_id, confidence, similarity) 3. "},{"id":"spn-49900","marks":["code"],"text":"outcomes"},{"id":"spn-49901","text":" — from actual "},{"id":"spn-49902","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", ...)"},{"id":"spn-49903","text":" calls 4. "},{"id":"spn-49904","marks":["code"],"text":"contradictions"},{"id":"spn-49905","text":" — count "},{"id":"spn-49906","marks":["code"],"text":"contradicts"},{"id":"spn-49907","text":" edges found during inspection 5. "},{"id":"spn-49908","marks":["code"],"text":"knowledge_gaps"},{"id":"spn-49909","text":" — questions the graph couldn't answer 6. "},{"id":"spn-49910","marks":["code"],"text":"supporting_evidence_count"},{"id":"spn-49911","text":" — number of "},{"id":"spn-49912","marks":["code"],"text":"supports"},{"id":"spn-49913","text":" edges found 7. "},{"id":"spn-49914","marks":["code"],"text":"coverage_estimate"},{"id":"spn-49915","text":" — your honest assessment (0.0-1.0)"}]},{"id":"blk-43644","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49916","text":"Standalone Coverage Query (No Goal Required)"}]},{"id":"blk-43645","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49917","text":"For quick coverage assessment without a goal:"}]},{"id":"blk-43646","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"retrieve(action: \"coverage\", query: \"auth middleware token validation\", limit: 10, expansion_hops: 1)"},{"id":"blk-43647","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49918","text":"Returns coverage score, decision (act/learn/escalate), relevant nodes, and confidence stats. Use this when you want a fast coverage check without creating or linking to a goal."}]},{"id":"blk-43648","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49919","marks":["bold"],"text":"`retrieve(action: \"coverage\")` vs `route(action: \"review_goal\")`:"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-43650","spans":[{"id":"spn-49920","text":""}]},{"id":"blk-43651","spans":[{"id":"spn-49921","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve(action: \"coverage\")"}]},{"id":"blk-43652","spans":[{"id":"spn-49922","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"review_goal\")"}]}],"id":"blk-43649","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-43653","spans":[{"id":"spn-49923","marks":["bold"],"text":"Requires goal"}]},{"id":"blk-43654","spans":[{"id":"spn-49924","text":"No"}]},{"id":"blk-43655","spans":[{"id":"spn-49925","text":"Yes"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43656","spans":[{"id":"spn-49926","marks":["bold"],"text":"Requires signal"}]},{"id":"blk-43657","spans":[{"id":"spn-49927","text":"No (auto-retrieves)"}]},{"id":"blk-43658","spans":[{"id":"spn-49928","text":"Yes (you build the signal)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43659","spans":[{"id":"spn-49929","marks":["bold"],"text":"State transitions"}]},{"id":"blk-43660","spans":[{"id":"spn-49930","text":"None"}]},{"id":"blk-43661","spans":[{"id":"spn-49931","text":"Optional (apply_decision)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-43662","spans":[{"id":"spn-49932","marks":["bold"],"text":"Use when"}]},{"id":"blk-43663","spans":[{"id":"spn-49933","text":"Quick pre-action check"}]},{"id":"blk-43664","spans":[{"id":"spn-49934","text":"Formal goal-driven review"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-43665","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49935","text":"Workflow Patterns"}]},{"id":"blk-43666","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49936","text":"Pre-action gate"}]},{"id":"blk-43667","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49937","marks":["code"],"text":"retrieve"},{"id":"spn-49938","text":" -> build signal -> "},{"id":"spn-49939","marks":["code"],"text":"route(action: \"review_goal\")"},{"id":"spn-49940","text":" -> if "},{"id":"spn-49941","marks":["code"],"text":"act"},{"id":"spn-49942","text":", proceed; if "},{"id":"spn-49943","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-49944","text":", gather more; if "},{"id":"spn-49945","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate"},{"id":"spn-49946","text":", block."}]},{"id":"blk-43668","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49947","text":"Iterative review loop"}]},{"id":"blk-43669","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49948","text":"After a "},{"id":"spn-49949","marks":["code"],"text":"learn"},{"id":"spn-49950","text":" decision: retrieve more -> store findings -> re-review -> eventually reach "},{"id":"spn-49951","marks":["code"],"text":"act"},{"id":"spn-49952","text":" or "},{"id":"spn-49953","marks":["code"],"text":"escalate"},{"id":"spn-49954","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-43670","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49955","text":"Post-failure review"}]},{"id":"blk-43671","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49956","text":"After "},{"id":"spn-49957","marks":["code"],"text":"learn(action: \"from_outcome\", status: \"failure\")"},{"id":"spn-49958","text":": re-review the goal to reassess coverage with the new negative signal."}]},{"id":"blk-43672","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49959","text":"High-stakes review (strict thresholds)"}]},{"id":"blk-43673","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"route(action: \"review_goal\", goal_id: \"<id>\", signal: { ... }, options: {\"thresholds\": {\"act\": 0.85, \"learn\": 0.5}})"},{"id":"blk-43674","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-49960","text":"Anti-patterns to avoid"}]},{"id":"blk-43675","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43677","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49961","text":"Signal fabrication — building signals from made-up data instead of real retrieval"}]}],"id":"blk-43676","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43679","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49962","text":"Review theater — calling review_goal but ignoring the act/learn/escalate decision"}]}],"id":"blk-43678","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-43681","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-49963","text":"Skipping review before high-stakes actions"}]}],"id":"blk-43680","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaiera2kdtbwidego3rupdbkf5wvw7x7b6lfpay4eue3jbbvg4dtukhmzq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}